  "EditorMetadata": {
    "Description": "CA-01..CA-06 component-access demo (CROSS-ENTITY READ). Instance blueprint (Instance dispatch uses Variables, not Parameters). Declares an Entity variable (TargetEntity, exposed on spawn); GetVariable reads it and wires it into GetComponent\u003CBpComponentDemo\u003E\u0027s optional Target pin -- unlike GetComponentDemo (self-only, Target unwired), this reads BpComponentDemo off whatever entity TargetEntity points to. Health/Ammo/Found mirrored into OutHealth/OutAmmo/OutFound via SetVariable, same as GetComponentDemo. Pair with GetComponentDemo (self read) and SetComponentDemo (write half).",
    "Category": "Demo",
    "Recipe": null
  }
